<title>HONG KONG: Hongkong China 1996 net rises 23.13 pct.</title>
<headline>Hongkong China 1996 net rises 23.13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   42.0	  vs  36.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0	   vs  4.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  306.42 gain vs  221.15 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    545.38	vs  442.95</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,360.98    vs  1,286.48</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hongkong China Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 20-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Investment holding firm Hongkong China engages in property investment and marina and berthing services.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$253.43 million on disposal of investment properties and gain of HK$52.99 million on disposal of an associated company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 7.4 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 2.4 cents).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
